  72:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h **** /**
  73:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * @addtogroup FLASH
  74:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * @brief Flash driver for XMC microcontroller family.
  75:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  *
  76:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * Flash is a non volatile memory module used to store instruction code or constant data.
  77:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * The flash low level driver provides support to the following functionalities of flash memory.<BR
  78:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * <OL>
  79:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * \if XMC4
  80:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * <LI>Provides function to program a page. ( XMC_FLASH_ProgramPage() )</LI><BR>
  81:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * <LI>Provides functions to support read and write protection. ( XMC_FLASH_InstallProtection(), 
  82:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * XMC_FLASH_ConfirmProtection(), XMC_FLASH_VerifyReadProtection(), XMC_FLASH_VerifyWriteProtection
  83:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * <LI>Provides function to erase sector. ( XMC_FLASH_EraseSector() ) </LI><BR> 
  84:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * \endif
  85:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * \if XMC1
  86:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * <LI>Provides functions to program and verify pages. ( XMC_FLASH_ProgramPage(), XMC_FLASH_Program
  87:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  *  XMC_FLASH_ProgramVerifyPage() )</LI><BR>
  88:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * <LI>Provides functions to write and verify blocks. ( XMC_FLASH_WriteBlocks(), XMC_FLASH_VerifyBl
  89:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * <LI>Provides functions to read data in terms of word and blocks. ( XMC_FLASH_ReadBlocks(), XMC_F
  90:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * </LI><BR> 
  91:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * <LI>Provides function to erase page. ( XMC_FLASH_ErasePage() ) </LI><BR> 
  92:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * \endif
  93:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * </OL>
  94:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  * @{
  95:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h ****  */
  96:D:/SoftWar_Debug/XMC1300_GPIO/Libraries/XMCLib/inc\xmc_flash.h **** 
